<title>UK: SNCF sets 10 billion peseta bond due 2002.</title>
<headline>SNCF sets 10 billion peseta bond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Central Hispano and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE NATIONALE DES CHEMINS DE FER</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    21.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.585   PAY DATE    21.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
